    .example-1 = a service object's properties and methods
    .example-2 = only the properties
man-Get-Date = gets the date and time (a DateTime object, with Year, Month, Day, Hour, DayOfWeek… and methods like AddDays). With -Format, a text: yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm.
    .synopsis = Get-Date [[-Date] <DateTime>] [-Format <String>]
